{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "f34d20a912b0fde1",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性/02-計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性.png",
			"x": -280,
			"y": -260,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 222
		},
		{
			"id": "1f5f8ad332241469",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Cache Coherence Pb. 是指橫向的 cache 跟 cache 之間不一致，如果是單一個 cache 跟 main memory 那個叫做 inconsistent",
			"x": -255,
			"y": 20,
			"width": 351,
			"height": 85,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "bb47310030933249",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性/03-計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性.png",
			"x": -280,
			"y": 180,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 107
		},
		{
			"id": "59fe5dd2fbd7191c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "解決 Cache coherence Pb. 就叫做 Cache coherence protocols",
			"x": 180,
			"y": 206,
			"width": 279,
			"height": 55,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "88370512c89da3d4",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性/05-兩種 protocol.png",
			"x": -280,
			"y": 360,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 141
		},
		{
			"id": "328e3eeeed24b3e5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 兩種 protocol \n\t1. 寫之前先把廣播出去，讓其他人的 Cache 改成無效 block\n\t2. 那麼另一個就是把 Cache 要更改的時候會把最新的資料廣播出去讓其他更新",
			"x": 180,
			"y": 339,
			"width": 353,
			"height": 184,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "f902743aa5841628",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "垂直方向的策略會影響到橫向的策略複雜度例如選擇 write-back 那麼設計橫向的 protocol 會比較複雜",
			"x": 620,
			"y": 598,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 115,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "6e8df3e6746d12b9",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性/06-兩種 protocol.png",
			"x": 156,
			"y": 600,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 113
		},
		{
			"id": "342d21501abb8ede",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性/08-兩種 protocol.png",
			"x": -20,
			"y": 840,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 240
		},
		{
			"id": "60e2a674bdfc913f",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性/09-計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性.png",
			"x": 470,
			"y": 840,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 253
		},
		{
			"id": "06324f4241901472",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性/01-計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性.png",
			"x": -880,
			"y": -260,
			"width": 472,
			"height": 222
		},
		{
			"id": "652adc674e6f3089",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性/04-計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性.png",
			"x": -880,
			"y": 319,
			"width": 468,
			"height": 224
		},
		{
			"id": "6b15b121487b1506",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "那麼透過 snoop tag 用來處理或是接收的硬體",
			"x": -1200,
			"y": 404,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 55,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "208b8b99bb37fa54",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性/07-計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性.png",
			"x": -902,
			"y": 683,
			"width": 512,
			"height": 277
		},
		{
			"id": "c07ac3213e93ef33",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性/11-這邊是接收者的狀態轉換.png",
			"x": -919,
			"y": 1040,
			"width": 546,
			"height": 180
		},
		{
			"id": "2722c992ae371d3f",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性/17-這邊是在說 sender 的狀態轉換.png",
			"x": -1495,
			"y": 1600,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 372
		},
		{
			"id": "966ff96fdbb85365",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 這邊是在說 sender 的狀態轉換\n- shared\n\t- read hit 在 shared 狀態的時候根本就不用換狀態，然後 CPU read miss 搬 block 上來，並且也要廣播出去，那麼也不用轉換狀態。\n\t- CPU write hit 那麼就發送廣播把其他人幹掉跑到 Exclusive\n\t- CPU write miss 那麼廣播出去，然後不管他怎麼處理，再寫入 memory，然後髒掉了所以要跑到 Exclusive\n- exclusive\n\t- CPU write-hit 和 read hit 都是保持在該狀態\n\t- 那 write-miss 也是一樣要廣播其他人怎麼處理是他們，然後 write-back 到 memory 再搬上來新的 block 然後一樣保持在這裡。\n\t- read-miss 也是一樣廣播然後 write-back 寫回去 block，然後沒有寫所以狀態跑回去 shared，讓大家都可以讀寫。\n- Invalid \n\t- CPU 讀也就是 read miss 廣播出去然後轉到 shared 狀態。\n\t- 然後 CPU write miss 一樣寫資料變髒髒了，就讓其他人不能使用就廣播然後，轉狀態到 Exclusive",
			"x": -1580,
			"y": 2062,
			"width": 600,
			"height": 478,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "22138a8b2f064d7f",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_05_快取一致性/10-這邊是接收者的狀態轉換.png",
			"x": -1520,
			"y": 993,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 275
		},
		{
			"id": "01295546df502486",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 這邊是接收者的狀態轉換",
			"x": -1445,
			"y": 1353,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "37c5b1342f8c3f69",
